      "claim": "In patients with brain tumors, paclitaxel was measured in resected tumor tissue after systemic administration, indicating meaningful CNS access in the setting of tumor-associated BBB disruption.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C05"],
      "claim": "Hydroxysafflor yellow A reached 1026 ng/g in rat brain after systemic administration, demonstrating direct BBB penetration.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
