    "Morgan similarity scores are low (approximately 0.20-0.25), limiting transferability of the evidence molecules to the query molecule.",
    "Most negative evidence was generated under normal BBB conditions rather than in brain tumor or glioma settings.",
    "Paclitaxel evidence is mixed, with multiple normal-barrier negative records and one tumor-condition positive record."
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [],
  "revision_action": "initial"
}

